  "faqStreakQuestion": "How does the streak system work?",
  "faqStreakAnswer": "Your streak increases each day you complete all scheduled habits. Missing a scheduled day resets your streak to zero. Rest days do not break your streak.",
  "faqAiQuestion": "What does the AI Analysis do?",
  "faqAiAnswer": "The AI Analysis reviews your habit data — streaks, progress, and completion patterns — and generates a personalized summary with insights and recommendations.",
  "faqReminderQuestion": "How do I set a reminder for a habit?",
  "faqReminderAnswer": "When creating a new habit, tap the notification bell icon to set a daily reminder. You can also update reminders by editing an existing habit.",
  "faqChangeDaysQuestion": "Can I change the days a habit repeats?",
  "faqChangeDaysAnswer": "Yes. When creating or editing a habit, select the days of the week you want the habit to be active. Unselected days are treated as rest days.",
  "faqProgressResetQuestion": "Why was my progress reset?",
  "faqProgressResetAnswer": "Progress resets if you missed completing a habit on a scheduled day. Routina checks for missed days automatically when you open the app.",
  "faqPrivacyQuestion": "Is my data private?",
  "faqPrivacyAnswer": "Yes. Your data is stored securely and is only accessible to your account. Screenshots are blocked within the app to protect your privacy.",
  "faqDeleteQuestion": "How do I delete a habit?",
  "faqDeleteAnswer": "Long press on a habit card to reveal the delete option. Deleted habits are permanently removed along with their progress data.",
  "faqOfflineQuestion": "Does Routina work offline?",
  "faqOfflineAnswer": "Core habit tracking requires an internet connection to sync with the server. Offline support is planned for a future update.",
